/-!
# Orders of the sporadic groups from permutation representations: target signatures

**This file is not the roadmap and is not exhaustive.** The definitive document is `README.md`.
The declarations here suggest Lean forms for its targets. Discharging all of them finishes neither
a work item nor the roadmap. `sorry` is allowed in this human-owned roadmap library: these are
targets, not completed definitions or proofs.

Each model is the subgroup of `Equiv.Perm (Fin n)` generated by the ATLAS standard generators,
written in Tau Ceti with `Hex.PermGroup.Kernel.permOfImages` from the `hex-perm-group-mathlib`
dependency of O0. That dependency is not available to this roadmap library, so the models are
`sorry` here.
-/

